Swift Digital Ledger – Institution & User Onboarding Guide

Version 1.0

⸻

1. Introduction

This guide provides a simple overview of how institutions and their users can onboard to the Swift Digital Ledger Portal. It explains the basic steps required to submit onboarding information, receive user credentials, and complete the first login.
Once onboarding is complete, users can log in to the Swift Digital Ledger application and access the main dashboard. From there, this guide will walk users through how to navigate the platform and provide an overview of the key features available.

⸻

2. Onboarding Initiation

The onboarding process consists of two simple steps:

⸻

STEP 1 — Institution Sends Onboarding Information

The institution must send one email to the Swift Digital Ledger Onboarding Team with the required onboarding details.

Send email to:
📨 swiftdigitalledger-onboarding@swift.com

The onboarding team will use this information to create all user accounts for the institution.

Required Information
	•	Institution / Company Name
	•	BIC Code
	•	List of Users containing:
	•	Full Name
	•	Email Address

⸻

Email Template for Institutions

Subject: Onboarding Request

To: swiftdigitalledger-onboarding@swift.com**

Dear Swift Digital Ledger Team,

We would like to onboard our institution to the Swift Digital Ledger Portal.
Please find below the required information:

Institution Name:
[Insert Institution Name]

BIC Code:
[Insert BIC]

User List:
	1.	Full Name: [Name] — Email: [Email]
	2.	Full Name: [Name] — Email: [Email]
	3.	Full Name: [Name] — Email: [Email]
(Add more users if needed)

Please proceed with creating the user accounts.

Thank you,
[Your Name]
[Your Position]
[Institution Name]

⸻

STEP 2 — Each User Receives a Welcome Email

Once the onboarding request is processed, each user listed by the institution will receive an individual Welcome Email.

This email will contain:
	•	Their username (their email address)
	•	Their initial password (already set)
	•	Instructions for first-time login
	•	A link to the Swift Digital Ledger portal

⸻

