⸻

3. First-Time Login

Once you receive your welcome email, follow the steps below to access the Swift Digital Ledger Portal for the first time.

⸻

Step 1 — Go to the Login Page

Open the Swift Digital Ledger Portal:

🌐 https://portal.swiftdigitalledger.com
(Replace with the official portal URL if applicable)

Enter your:
	•	Username (your email address)
	•	Password (provided in your welcome email)

Click Sign In.

⸻

Step 2 — Enter the OTP Code

After signing in:
	1.	You will receive a One-Time Password (OTP) by email.
	2.	Look for the message titled:
“Swift Digital Ledger – Your Verification Code”
	3.	Enter the 6-digit OTP on the login screen.
	4.	Click Verify Code.

⸻

Step 3 — Access Granted

Once the OTP is verified, you will be redirected to the main dashboard and can start using the Swift Digital Ledger system.


Minimum System Requirements

To ensure the Swift Digital Ledger Portal functions smoothly, users should meet the following minimum system requirements:
	•	Internet Connection: Stable broadband connection
	•	Supported Web Browsers: Latest versions of Chrome, Edge, Firefox, or Safari
	•	Device Compatibility: Desktop or laptop computer (recommended). Mobile and tablet access may have limited functionality.
	•	Email Access: Ability to receive verification and notification emails
	•	Security Settings: Cookies and JavaScript enabled

These requirements help ensure reliable access and optimal performance of the Swift Digital Ledger application.


